&lt;li&gt;Proven success developing workforce analysts or schedulers through coaching, clear expectations, and accountability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting 24/7, multichannel operations and partnering with BPOs across sites or time zones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical judgment, with the ability to anticipate risks, uncover root causes, and turn data into practical recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
