&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Experience planning for peak demand and managing workforce responses to outages or service disruptions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A bachelor’s degree or an equivalent combination of education and relevant experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building WFM processes from the ground up or supporting high-growth or gig-economy operations preferred&lt;/li&gt;
